  1
Authored 650 x 300 mm strip footing, 200 mm stem, 125 mm independent slab, 25 mm slab-edge isolation, 100 mm under-slab insulation and 50 mm blinding. Three T16 longitudinal bars and T12 transverse bars at 200 mm are nominal; 75 mm lower cover is measured to bar surface. Wall/stem depth is a schematic study, not a frost-depth prescription.
